341   Record Retention
342     NIST 800-53 Fields: AU-9(2), AU-11
343     Records are held in compliance with the National Archives & Records Administration (NARA)
344     Records Schedule. Records retained for clients are categorized as (Record Category / Series # / Title
345     / File #) 817 IT Security 817-5 IT Security "Security Audit Logs." These are disposed in accordance
346     with GRS 3-2-030 under disposition authority DAA-GRS2013-00060003.
347
348     Records will be backed up at least weekly in a repository that is part of a physically different system
349     or system component than the system or component being audited.
350
351     The Development Operations Lead shall be responsible for enabling this section.

352   Access by Dispel Employees to Client Audit Records
353     NIST 800-53 Field: AU-9(4)
354     Client audit records stored on log servers within a Dispel Zero Trust Engine or other deployment
355     may be accessed by authorized System Administrators. System Administrators are authorized on a
356     per-client basis by the Customer for single-tenanted deployments, which cover all Dispel Zero Trust
357     Engine deployments.

